      "text": "Control Software Package\n\n-> collects feedback from sensors\n-> evaluates current mode, missions active, actions to be taken\n-> calculates references to motors\n-> sets references to motors\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Control Software Package\n\n-> collects feedback from sensors\n-> evaluates current mode, missions active, actions to be taken\n-> calculates references to motors\n-> sets references to motors\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
